+copy; that is not evidence that the target board is empty. Resolve the scheduler
+row, the target checkout, and the owning board, then read the canonical board
+and its latest dogfood record before deciding whether work changed. Keep the
+stand-in limitation separate from product state, and never fabricate a board in
+the stand-in just to satisfy the lane checklist.
